{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_title", "source_sha256": "34e29ad83aadb8dc9420e7bc7eb5a624e134f2fb8dffad8ed189d5e75d254721", "ja": "虹の彼方、先へ", "zh": "彩虹的彼端，向着前方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4cd6b169b02ed5ecfa63c3d99d9cff691301f6e1f5094e8917550e5d35a6f565", "ja": "憧れのミュージカルにアンサンブル出演が\n決まった可奈。ソロパートのため奮闘するが\n練習では叱られてばかり。落ち込む可奈に声\nを掛けたのはいつかの男の子だった。仲間の\n応援と新曲を手に、可奈はテストに挑む。", "zh": "可奈决定出演梦寐以求的音乐剧的合唱阵容。\n虽然为了独唱段落奋发努力，但排练中却总是\n挨骂。向沮丧的可奈搭话的，是之前遇到的男\n孩子。伴随同伴的加油与新歌，可奈挑战测试。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e2a7a33a5f889dfdd8b982b5114f2543b7d13d62e007ea42962dcefe7564c3a7", "ja": "（可奈、恵美、麗花の3人はオーディションに\n無事合格！　早速、合同レッスンが始まった）", "zh": "（可奈、惠美和丽花3人顺利通过了试镜！合同训练马上开始了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1001_ensyutuka", "source_sha256": "5b116783765bcc4bb5dfdf789bfe90c0d978fa451d389a5ab8d79251096da93d", "ja": "……次に、アンサンブルについてですが、\n今回はそれぞれ役名が決まっています。", "zh": "……接下来是关于合唱群舞演员，\n这次每位都定下了角色名。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1002_ensyutuka", "source_sha256": "98e531305a64e540a3bcc478c79d4552a0e8176c372d46f87c89de640fb72b62", "ja": "役によっては、ソロパートを担当してもらう人も\nいますので、そのつもりでお願いします。", "zh": "根据分配到的角色，有些人可能会负责\n独唱部分，还请做好相应的准备。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "a70cdc8761eedf9d228639df92a31db3ba563797375044efbff3830738889adf", "ja": "（えっ。そ、ソロパートがあるんだ……！\nううっ、そんなの絶対、やってみたい！）", "zh": "（咦。竟、竟然有独唱部分……！\n呜呜，那种机会我绝对想试试！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1004_ensyutuka", "source_sha256": "42125aa24bf6f11d01d280c0700f0959f54ca868e4aa3c317d444c905af870da", "ja": "役については、別途オーディションを行います。\n自由曲と課題曲を歌ってもらう予定です。", "zh": "关于角色，将会另行举办试镜。\n届时预定会让大家演唱自选曲与指定曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "0e2405067fcedcf564fdb42ae9c854e477559aaf347cba927ffabbcff2275936", "ja": "（オーディションに合格したら、かぁ。よ～し！\n絶対ソロパートもらえるよう、がんばるぞ！　お～♪）", "zh": "（通过试镜的话，就能拿到 solo 部分吗。好～！\n为了绝对能拿到 solo 部分，我要加油啦！哦～♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1006_ensyutuka", "source_sha256": "cb0d2e3816d79546d2d81542f0f8df03ce8e845af1f3c1034c37181380df1f45", "ja": "……では次に、メンバーの自己紹介です。\n765プロダクションの矢吹さん、お願いします。", "zh": "……接下来请成员们做自我介绍。\n765事务所的矢吹小姐，请开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1007_036kan", "source_sha256": "3be57fcdeaa78a995267b9224c6fe548368ebfd4eff6133ed9bcfaf951080383", "ja": "は、はいっ！　矢吹可奈、14歳です！\nミュージカルは初挑戦です……！", "zh": "是、是的！我是矢吹可奈，14岁！这是我第一次挑战音乐剧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "58d603ad8e7583d2267aeb6a4882554532bce6b65ac6866049bec6f04a9112f5", "ja": "でも、歌うことが大好きなので……そ、ソロパートが\nもらえるよう、がんばりたいと思います！", "zh": "不过，我最喜欢唱歌了……所、所以我想努力争取到独唱部分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1009_se", "source_sha256": "93d231fd981e3c9dd69d44316255db770022655a0fdbf418146f56dd92e2fa67", "ja": "パチパチパチ", "zh": "啪啪啪啪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "3d2f7ad805a00449df064096131595f0e7772fa3d0cd0e66a3689bc18b653f80", "ja": "やるじゃん、可奈♪\n思い切った目標掲げたね～！", "zh": "干得不错嘛，可奈♪  \n还真是鼓起勇气定下了目标呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "fb7798c6e1b668d6967d0eb87e47dfedeb3e86c0ea75e96edf09b429645c7634", "ja": "その意気だよ、可奈ちゃん！\n私も負けないように、一生懸命頑張るね♪", "zh": "就是这个劲头，可奈！  \n我也会努力加油，不输给你哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "d7fb3fd38cc11b273ddef2608e044c319dbbaa47d2b285069c1b8196aa8a446c", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！　えへへ、\n思い切って言ってよかった～……？", "zh": "啊，谢谢你！嘿嘿，\n鼓起勇气说出来真是太好了～……吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1013_kohoseia", "source_sha256": "5d7d832a8f5300f70a6893d8329a92ab4a586276ac27dc334fc944cce5eeee9e", "ja": "何あれ。ソロパートをもらえるようにだって。\n普通、わざわざみんなの前で宣言する？", "zh": "那是什么情况。说是为了能拿到独唱部分。  \n一般来说，谁会特意当着大家的面宣布这种事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1014_kohoseib", "source_sha256": "c40372189761600a0fef206a28993d80c0ff3ad673f56a436d44de9749c2df4a", "ja": "生意気だよね。中学生でオーディション\n受かったからって、調子乗ってるんじゃない？", "zh": "真够狂妄的。就因为还是初中生就通过了试镜，开始得意忘形了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "9cdb9419e23be6bc1f9c74fc9a97b368d2ffd82de2ab000506400a522285b2d6", "ja": "……可奈、気にしなくて大丈夫だよ。\n言いたい子には、言わせておけばいいんだから。", "zh": "……可奈，不用去在意的。\n想说的人，就随她们去说好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "32570ba1c033bceba886381cef53631f5d100631426a14b70eea80095b0b2806", "ja": "は、はい。私、全然平気です！　それにバンドの時\nみたいに、話してみたら、いい人かもしれないし！", "zh": "是、是的。我完全没事！而且，说不定像组乐队时那样聊聊看，对方也许是个好人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "15f31ddc9869a0e678220fe837725dbc57f68cc01fa287dab9d39b552b8e60ec", "ja": "こんなことじゃ凹まないぞ～♪\nがんばれ可奈～、ゴーゴゴ～♪", "zh": "我才不会因为这种事消沉呢～♪\n加油，可奈～，冲冲冲～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1019_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1020_sensei", "source_sha256": "7791d07d924824510c50aa3c47b7127098a8a9b70d39e458eb6bc78258272180", "ja": "ほら、矢吹さん！\nもっとお腹から声を出して！", "zh": "来，矢吹！再多用腹部发声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "725d84536ad037e5919c2ac8af51b51101c24acd1e4aa55bddcc638e92de423f", "ja": "は、はい！　すみません！\nあ～あ～あ～あ～あ～♪", "zh": "是、是的！对不起！\n啊～啊～啊～啊～啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1022_sensei", "source_sha256": "998e7d84422c60336e1f2ea6fcf1508efdb9f6653b8c7b1dad981a35b357b45c", "ja": "今度は音程がズレてる！\nただ声を出せばいいってものじゃないのよ！", "zh": "这次音准又跑掉了！\n可不是光发出声音就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1023_036kan", "source_sha256": "a3904023814b7c9fb55e1cf3ce02e181b13bd8d07c6ceb4285e8893652b7b160", "ja": "も、もう1回お願いします！\nあ～あ～あ～あ～あ～♪", "zh": "请、请让我再来1次！\n啊～啊～啊～啊～啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "92ab3a0ec425a83d3d219357a4d3bf55f88eab3b0421e26426bc2f1039136785", "ja": "ここで、ターン！\n……せ、先生、どうですか？", "zh": "现在，转身！\n\n……老、老师，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1025_sensei", "source_sha256": "03a56f866cb49bdc7be94c3bf2099d082ba946d8efc371d50f15f02916ad698d", "ja": "全然ダメね、テンポが遅れているわ。\n最後、右足を出すタイミングが少し遅いのよ。", "zh": "完全不行呢，节奏慢了。\n最后，迈出右脚的时机稍微晚了一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1026_036kan", "source_sha256": "06ddee4688de8612c55bc917c984a6e951a8099adf9457497fe242c4a445ffd4", "ja": "む、難しいな……。\n……よ、よ～し、もう1回！", "zh": "唔，好、好难啊……  \n……好、好——再来1次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1027_null", "source_sha256": "6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e", "ja": "数日後……", "zh": "过了几天后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1028_sensei", "source_sha256": "857b02e14fa72197e8ee16c56632b25af04bbd9fe9d52564a39b108355b8ed8e", "ja": "……うん、前よりよくなったわ。\n先週指摘した所、しっかり練習してきたわね！", "zh": "……嗯，比之前好多了。\n上周指出的地方，有好好练习过了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1029_kohoseia", "source_sha256": "5d2b051e589ed457ad5e7ea2770e9180d00a0a03fd7b82eab30a39041c6a35b0", "ja": "は、はい！\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "啊、好的！\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1030_sensei", "source_sha256": "2b0b728822a8df16dbf88e68d19b1a2fc0c49d8f829f1d1548d37c09362cbbfc", "ja": "それじゃ次は、矢吹さんね。\n前に出て、歌ってみてくれる？", "zh": "那么接下来轮到矢吹了。\n请到前面来唱唱看，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "79df12aaa594347d24b402da4f0d2ea4f87ee97459b76fab3efd1666cb64ec1e", "ja": "は、はい……！　がんばります！\nよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "好、好的……！我会加油的！\n请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1032_sensei", "source_sha256": "771fd8a326f58c125a0ec738a7f49eb0820be252120e835fd27d5a841e11f9fe", "ja": "ん～、まだまだね。これくらいできるはずよ？\nもっと頑張って！", "zh": "嗯～还差得远呢。这点程度应该能做到吧？  \n再加把劲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "469337035ac405fd60c6b0b6c048f2e777c7d452c426a7cf2c86dd0a68bf834d", "ja": "……は、はい。すみません。\n……。", "zh": "……是、是的。对不起。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1034_kohoseia", "source_sha256": "3e12673c6168d31406bff9b1cf838ac0e2a2ce4d94e76555be57c407ac204e6e", "ja": "矢吹さん、また同じところ注意されてる。\nこれ、そんなに難しくないよね？", "zh": "矢吹又在同一个地方被提醒了。\n这个，不是很难吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1035_kohoseib", "source_sha256": "042bb62529129446c48559dff37b1673042acc5f8f756739347011ad91c990fc", "ja": "あれじゃ、ソロパートなんて絶対無理でしょ。\nふふっ。", "zh": "那样的话，独唱部分肯定是不行的吧。\n呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1036_036kan", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1037_p", "source_sha256": "c4394025ca9f30b12a6c0bab8e5cf4369cafb1c8ef868088fa342a9544e90ac3", "ja": "（打ち合わせで近くまで来たから、様子を見に来たけど\n……可奈、だいぶ絞られているみたいだな。）", "zh": "（因为来商量，正好到了附近，所以过来看看情况……可奈，看来被狠狠训练了一番啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1038_p", "source_sha256": "71b80fd7ced39cdc452318663b7dd315915f943a204e2349e4282a1586e45848", "ja": "（先生のあの言い方は、見込みがあるからなんだろう。\nレッスンが終わったら、可奈に声を掛けておくか）", "zh": "（老师刚才那种说法，是因为觉得可奈还有潜力吧。\n等课程结束后，要不要去跟可奈说几句呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "3ea8d16672449a7f92a1494d5b60f06fbd05978fdf3a01747ea4bfb3a70ab4e7", "ja": "…………はぁ。\n今日もいっぱい、怒られちゃったな。", "zh": "…………唉。\n今天又挨了好多训啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "26724559e3836ba4a7e6213548a444e8a0812353345f0f22c160c259650cf8ca", "ja": "また、私だけ……。\nみんなはどんどん上手になってるのに……。", "zh": "又是只有我……。\n明明大家都越来越厉害了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1041_p", "source_sha256": "e652ca16ad1591544e04564c55655705aaff8c54766ddabfd82d5e4e4931291d", "ja": "可奈、お疲れさま。\nちょっと話したいんだけど、大丈夫か？", "zh": "可奈，辛苦了。\n想和你聊聊，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1042_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b9da29f4f73c3bb991fb23d0649379d2f9ebe0829650e19f6e60b536603f02d", "ja": "はれっ？　{$P$}さん、\nいつの間に来てたんですかっ！？", "zh": "诶？{$P$}先生，你什么时候来的呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1043_p", "source_sha256": "1d82ce7b5fcf27ddd74aace99b7befc00b2def388327bd625722d99e4086b9e2", "ja": "ついさっきな。それより、大丈夫か？", "zh": "就在刚才。比起这个，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1044_036kan", "source_sha256": "e6b4a884bbe3d5a21f970285dfb49f15e36b3a2d134579e695ed0b43c0b4964e", "ja": "だ、大丈夫です！　私ならへっちゃらですから！\n怒られるのはいつものこと～♪　だから慣れっこ～♪", "zh": "没、没关系！对我来说完全不算什么！\n被骂也是家常便饭啦～♪所以早就习惯了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "4977f763eefb4c9b3d3b55e7693a7191bebf5ec19ec293667d4ed0f286bbe706", "ja": "……えへへ。なんて、慣れちゃダメですよね。\n本当は、怒られないようにしないといけないのに。", "zh": "……诶嘿嘿。开玩笑的，可不能习惯这种事呢。\n明明本来应该努力做到不挨骂才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "25f0f8e0c73e6c1a5759bdb6d864f0eb3426efa8f0eca548f07a919003db03e7", "ja": "でも私、練習しても、全然上手にできなくて……。\n先生に怒られちゃうのも、当然ですよね。", "zh": "不过，我就算练习了，也完全做不好……。\n会被老师训斥，也是理所当然的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1047_p", "source_sha256": "a2583a71532f7d598d998ef10d7d9e7d4e684333e585cba6a6382c39840fe276", "ja": "可奈はいつも努力しているし、\n努力した分、ちゃんと成長していると思うよ。", "zh": "可奈一直都很努力，\n而且我觉得，你付出了多少努力，就确实收获了多少成长哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1048_p", "source_sha256": "5422340881a6d2b3e78e459614819d7ad9fa046c52751f80bcdc499b4ef0c734", "ja": "それに、先生が注意するのは、それだけ\n可奈に期待しているって事だと思うんだ。だから……。", "zh": "而且，老师会提醒你，说明对你抱有很大的期待。所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1049_036kan", "source_sha256": "f8902d388238a728293f9a22b3fee379568697b64f0f6c46d2c3b19bf2e014c0", "ja": "えへへ……{$P$}さん、優しいな～。\nありがとうございます。でも、大丈夫です！", "zh": "嘿嘿……{$P$}先生，你真温柔啊～  \n谢谢。不过，我没事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1050_036kan", "source_sha256": "ee0293ca2ef763702b2e3f00ab0b4a1f1f99683d7d694b6df755dc405c2bdfa2", "ja": "自分がまだまだなのは、私が一番わかってますから！\n……それじゃ、また明日！", "zh": "我最清楚自己还差得远呢！\n……那么，明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1051_p", "source_sha256": "377f36f3487b05f49d851c5e7767bf04875e14661a42392877a6a795a9158096", "ja": "あっ、可奈……！\n……慰めじゃなくて、本当の事なんだけどな。", "zh": "啊，可奈……！\n……我并不是在安慰她，说的都是实话啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1052_p", "source_sha256": "7968a7a4b3c1f4cec141b386d3fb4784fc01a19d2cdb297e3260d538f3f2fd0d", "ja": "（とはいえ、落ち込みはするものの、\n可奈は今の自分の実力も、やるべき事もわかっている）", "zh": "（话虽如此，可奈虽然会感到沮丧，却也明白自己现在的实力，以及该做些什么。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1053_p", "source_sha256": "b842ce33a4f41edd29a5094fb09e41d7b00bd209fc7e7d4ec23081bf0ad1f06f", "ja": "（なら……プロデューサーとして、\n他にできる事は……）", "zh": "（那么……作为制作人，我还能做些什么……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1054_null", "source_sha256": "1af139110744b9f6e364d59b7bdf52358721564949d0c7e3df9ef2e4b1806a4d", "ja": "さらに数日後……", "zh": "又过了几天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1055_p", "source_sha256": "6c4a6c3a20afa976e42e7149b40ccf36e4ba06ff5f8bc6a47ef57070fdd2ff4b", "ja": "（今日の合同レッスンは、可奈だけ参加。\n一方、春香と千早を含むメインキャストが合流した）", "zh": "（今天的联合排练只有可奈参加。\n另一方面，包括春香和千早在内的主要演员都汇合了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1056_p", "source_sha256": "fe637a151eb58d4b132d8e6253ce62343a4e09d758d656c5590d64176c0a45dd", "ja": "（可奈の様子も気になるし、\n次の打ち合わせまで、少しだけ見学して行こう）", "zh": "（也有些在意可奈的情况，就在下次开会前，稍微看一会儿再走吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1057_001har", "source_sha256": "96ecef9a79a46ffa8a475baa1b5a42c72e26b05cf4e499dc54b6b546e016c9f8", "ja": "765プロの天海春香です。今日からレッスンに\n参加します。よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "我是765艺能的天海春香。今天开始参加\n课程。请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1058_002chi", "source_sha256": "8493a3c180f1b9148aeb7acfec9ab2d5ae78db9f307fd401079f0ce32e6dd478", "ja": "同じく、765プロの如月千早です。\nよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "同样来自765事务所，我是如月千早。\n请多关照。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1059_p", "source_sha256": "b135f2f6dc42bfc91caa4d0337d182d00946a5b1bf454322a3ebfcf42e2a2817", "ja": "（メインキャストの合流は、初日並の緊張感だな……\n稽古場の雰囲気も、一気に引き締まった感じだ）", "zh": "（主角们的加入，让人感觉像第一天一样紧张啊……排练场的气氛也一下子变得紧绷起来了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1060_sensei", "source_sha256": "96d709e799b74e6217f5073325e17e1526994f737551b3183174b9a6c04a3066", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー、フォー、\nファイブ、シックス、セブン、エイト……。", "zh": "一、二、三、四、\n五、六、七、八……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1061_sensei", "source_sha256": "49f0bcf5783326ce512b87abe74e893723ea610004f1e73d90ba575b186a0121", "ja": "うん、バッチリよ！　天海さん、如月さんも、\nダンスはしっかりできていますね。", "zh": "嗯，非常完美！天海、如月，\n你们的舞蹈也跳得十分到位呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1062_036kan", "source_sha256": "d79a391d354a686811528ea6a64f8ef5bc7251090d4cbb8ad739060d844785d2", "ja": "うわぁ……！\n春香さんも、千早さんも、すごい……！", "zh": "哇……！\n春香小姐和千早小姐，好厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1063_p", "source_sha256": "48d3a7810805fc133a58ffcad62c1910b0aeab9ca36247763293d5290ddd31d6", "ja": "（可奈は、春香と千早のレッスンに見入っている。\nひどく真剣な表情だ……）", "zh": "（可奈正看着春香和千早的练习入了迷。表情认真极了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1064_p", "source_sha256": "2da85870ead74d127fb49af65139cea0548f7b99a01f37bf01d66f373471f20e", "ja": "（可奈の頑張りを、支えてやりたい。そのために、\nプロデューサーの自分にできる事は……そうだ！）", "zh": "（我想支持可奈的努力。为了做到这一点，身为制作人的我能做些什么……对了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1066_036kan", "source_sha256": "0a767161160353818ec4a71ad098e9c6b0ecaa7791f8674d1d6b74b4965343c0", "ja": "はぁ……{$P$}さんが帰ったあと、\nまた叱られちゃった。「全然できてない」って……。", "zh": "唉……{$P$}先生回去以后，我又被训了一顿。还说什么“完全没做好”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1067_036kan", "source_sha256": "fc02566681c0abd65671234e1f929e6d485fc3ea1c2d925c17c9bd354fb884c2", "ja": "春香さんと千早さん、すごかったなぁ。\nそれに比べて、私……ううっ。", "zh": "春香前辈和千早前辈，真的好厉害啊。\n跟她们一比，我……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1068_001har", "source_sha256": "0b9d8bbf948f75b072707ef8811889a0d6bfc7ef4ed2dfcf622615dd10aad55a", "ja": "あ、可奈ちゃん！　まだスタジオにいたんだね。\n千早ちゃん、可奈ちゃんこっちにいたよ。", "zh": "啊，可奈！你还在摄影棚里呀。\n千早，可奈在这边哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1069_036kan", "source_sha256": "fec37de53669f77dae182c38a43fa7e41ae89abbf388581fddd91aa2d87b2730", "ja": "春香さん？　それに、千早さんも……。", "zh": "春香姐？还有千早姐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1070_002chi", "source_sha256": "de962aba6a1e9053ad97052f2869720a56bd20e7c59dcaf0fcc7300fc4fe2b6e", "ja": "ごめんなさい。矢吹さんの様子が、少し気になって。\n……レッスン、もしかして上手くいってないの？", "zh": "对不起，我有点在意矢吹同学的状态。\n……练习是不是进行得不太顺利？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1071_036kan", "source_sha256": "43b1e282b77081fe63f133949c84b296244bf567dac6cd5c6f80cb209e880cd7", "ja": "……はい。私、みんなの中で一番できなくって。\n叱られてばっかりで……。", "zh": "……是的。我是大家里面做得最差的一个。\n总是被批评……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1072_036kan", "source_sha256": "0b0a75d6675bd481fe13acc6aa002623082fe675ea00c5b75160594b2c650268", "ja": "このままじゃ、ソロパートどころか、\n本番のステージにも立てないかも……ぐすっ。", "zh": "这样下去，别说独唱部分了，可能连正式演出都上不了……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1073_001har", "source_sha256": "0e53720d6d0ab19c18834c4f5b04b23f7a6405d21aaa8496e3d729de384f7877", "ja": "うん。……怒られると、不安になっちゃうよね。", "zh": "嗯……被责备的话，确实会变得不安呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1074_001har", "source_sha256": "0c795e6ca6843c21d62b7b8c86ce8ee74a193a6a0262c04c90aba6c26c547e3c", "ja": "でも、可奈ちゃんが一生懸命なのは、\n今日一日見てて、すっごく伝わってきたよ。", "zh": "不过，今天一整天看下来，我真的深深感受到可奈有多努力哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1075_036kan", "source_sha256": "83ed9b8fee1dc0cf0d2d49efe661f78dbf0f87791b068cc8c8324d6811d44577", "ja": "春香さん……。", "zh": "春香小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1076_002chi", "source_sha256": "1ef6709e3cccccc170304fa107734bee28275a57d42268347ac3b6a2abaf15eb", "ja": "矢吹さんは、自分ができていないところがどこか、\nわかっているのよね。だったら、大丈夫。", "zh": "矢吹同学，你知道自己哪里还做得不够好，对吧。那就没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1077_002chi", "source_sha256": "c04936f6c89ccd4d6d8741d5d5c0613973e90d017a90ae8517e64cd3058debab", "ja": "一緒に頑張りましょう。\n私たちも、手伝うわ。", "zh": "一起努力吧。\n我们也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1078_036kan", "source_sha256": "effa22125e4992d6a783817b0f7a6fcbbcc85122bb675422a91548f0f1cac543", "ja": "千早さん……。\n……。", "zh": "千早……。\n……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1079_002chi", "source_sha256": "9ecac0d8b4b2f1cf931a7e9015c6e43f49ffe3559b1da97362d6e96cb9b69ef3", "ja": "一度、劇場に戻りましょうか。\n{$P$}とも、話してみるといいわ。", "zh": "要不先回剧场吧。\n你也可以和{$P$}谈谈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1081_002chi", "source_sha256": "22557491e21e4e27d8d758477cb05f487b767dc84dfd6af7d927be040cba58ae", "ja": "{$P$}は、出かけているみたい。\n夕方までに戻ると言ってたって、青羽さんが。", "zh": "{$P$}好像出去了。\n青羽小姐说，听说会在傍晚前回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1082_001har", "source_sha256": "9f9e665b98f2a49524da6916a3176af1492797281cab0e76784e1e2d7afc2694", "ja": "そうなんだ……。ごめんね、可奈ちゃん。\n私たち、そろそろ次のお仕事に行かなきゃで……。", "zh": "这样啊……对不起，可奈。\n我们差不多该去做下一个工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1083_036kan", "source_sha256": "9dba0aaa58ffc89893e61fb2239e7a324d6b2423846c4c114ac63afde0715e64", "ja": "き、気にしないでください！　私は、\n今日のレッスンの復習をしますから！", "zh": "请、请别在意！我会复习今天的课程！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1084_001har", "source_sha256": "43322f72c9790846c7f90582b6dc9967ff68d80a6210bdd4407c394459249e6a", "ja": "うん。私たちも、夕方までには戻るから。\n一緒にレッスンしよう！　それじゃ、行ってくるね。", "zh": "嗯。我们也会在傍晚前回来的。\n一起练习吧！那我们先走啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1085_036kan", "source_sha256": "612acaa95e7af272062bc5e9e598fc8fd6e30d289b8912dc9aec03fe0dd42b98", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　いってらっしゃい！", "zh": "谢谢！路上小心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1086_se", "source_sha256": "3895b8b8bc665bcc3dce99bd9673f051731bf6ff889fa2990853e52534b9c07a", "ja": "……パタン", "zh": "……啪嗒", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1087_036kan", "source_sha256": "d7445e55c33b87ecbe7e8d8521d14458b80867f4f5b06eb55df310dc3e127732", "ja": "…………。\n……練習、しなくちゃ。", "zh": "…………。\n……必须得，练习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1089_036kan", "source_sha256": "2e71fadb47af679a43d262658d0fe46b5c1b5487d1474bb5d21345f6f4bf34d8", "ja": "ら～らら～♪　らら～……ぐすっ。", "zh": "啦～啦啦～♪　啦啦～……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1090_036kan", "source_sha256": "f28de8dd2aed0c7728582b78952672b72db2f9bb587a5bc0ed7f1cf8b7da3896", "ja": "せっかく、ミュージカルに出られるんだもん。\nソロパートに選ばれたいけど……。", "zh": "难得有机会出演音乐剧。\n虽然想被选中唱独唱部分，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1091_036kan", "source_sha256": "0c494154cbe8214d53bab32b4ce82bcf407ff37ea1c25dd6d2ef6c647fc12c25", "ja": "でも、このままじゃ無理かも……\n練習してるのに、全然上手く歌えないし……。", "zh": "可是，这样下去可能不行……明明一直在练习，却完全唱不好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1092_036kan", "source_sha256": "79f2d5a828d008630601bb3ecdcba607312df0199730d6ab6ca579bea73dac9a", "ja": "私だけ、全然ついていけないよ……。\n悔しいなぁ。こんなにがんばってるのになぁ……！", "zh": "就我一个人，完全跟不上……\n好不甘心啊。明明已经这么努力了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1093_036kan", "source_sha256": "df0394dde4d42ce60242fdd1bc1b33724ac3b157b56f4d58100a8bdab9f71777", "ja": "……ぐすっ。ら～らら～、ららら～♪", "zh": "……呜呜。啦～啦啦～，啦啦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1094_se", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1095_036kan", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1096_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "580a87da25b7a4b97eb12d1f82b5da03183975df5cedbeaad46a1ad6a0621417", "ja": "すご～い！\nおねえちゃん、おうた、じょうずになったね！", "zh": "好厉害～！  \n姐姐，歌唱得更好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1097_036kan", "source_sha256": "5aacffbe230944b8415afb60d7195f096f3f88715077a2409ad1ba6940b67836", "ja": "……あっ！？\nぼく、前にここで歌の練習してた……。", "zh": "……啊！？\n我以前在这里练习过唱歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1098_036kan", "source_sha256": "c96ef9c88dc6c621c9555688328867c11b50cc2393d8f9a7ec3f8c99d9847577", "ja": "えっと……ホントに、そうかな？\nお姉さん、お歌、上手になったかな……？", "zh": "那个……真的有吗？\n姐姐的歌，真的唱得更好了吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1099_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "8627e8a8c92befeef6e863628744254de3bfdfb78fc69059a2ac9dbfc9e02c46", "ja": "うん！　すっごくじょうずだったよ！", "zh": "嗯！做得特别棒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1100_036kan", "source_sha256": "fbc9036f2c6f6fb94e23b1ae5ac62bd73f723fc376b9bc188d9aff69f54c5d9d", "ja": "う……ううっ。うわぁ～～～ん！", "zh": "呜……呜呜。哇啊～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1101_chiisaiotokonoko", "source_sha256": "40db91779859a20a7e3541edb218238d1ee035d99d4c98e732a541b5340871ec", "ja": "えっ！？　どうしたの、おねえちゃん！\nどこかいたいの！？", "zh": "诶！？怎么了，姐姐！\n哪里疼吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1102_036kan", "source_sha256": "a6c09ba2b91e8d7f638474e490dc7787202c102c77699a2613d5b05341d64c2b", "ja": "う、ううん。そうじゃないの、ごめんね。\nぐすっ、えっと……。", "zh": "不、不是那样的，对不起。\n抽、抽泣……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1103_020meg", "source_sha256": "722188e69b08c310595dbf45ee857d155dc7988e6f73e05c2b1b9b3b126636f7", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}、可奈いたよ……\nって、どしたの！？　なんで泣いてるの！？", "zh": "啊！{$P$}，找到可奈了哦……\n等等，怎么了！？怎么哭了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1104_p", "source_sha256": "33491ec991988138d375c8df2cfc00a43fa5f56638ff9b87f9f25f2e991ef625", "ja": "ええっ！？\nどうしたんだ、可奈！", "zh": "咦！？  \n怎么了，可奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1105_036kan", "source_sha256": "9977e782ba77ed0169a5ff128a9a20f1aeb5cb8cedf29f95f648d059ebee723a", "ja": "あ、恵美さん、麗花さん……。\nううっ、ぐすっ……。", "zh": "啊，惠美姐、丽花姐……  \n呜呜，抽泣……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1106_048rei", "source_sha256": "19bd445de4bf1308a60586c30f9af5b87fca2bdc1fa6dc1799c7ef3d6cb2ef66", "ja": "大丈夫？　可奈ちゃん。\nその男の子は……？", "zh": "没事吧，可奈？\n那个男孩子……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1107_p", "source_sha256": "699dc5ac9e7766fda9ecbb920c617b316bb83e4feb58c2aecb356fecf2a00b94", "ja": "なるほど。可奈は男の子の言葉が嬉しくて、\nつい泣いてしまったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。可奈是因为那个男孩子的话感到开心，结果不小心哭出来了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1108_036kan", "source_sha256": "a824b6e0722ae7691e0f053d1e81e936928774caa54800fd3787e070cb3ea97e", "ja": "はい……。ごめんなさい、心配かけちゃって。\nあの子に、悪いことしちゃいました……。", "zh": "是……对不起，让你担心了。\n我好像做了对不起那孩子的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1109_p", "source_sha256": "95325779f5cbb7e35808a58a49f83d3002a78f6dea0d6205deac7270d3939c0e", "ja": "謝らなくても大丈夫。あの子も、びっくりしてたけど、\n可奈の事は心配ないってちゃんと話しておいたから。", "zh": "不用道歉，没关系。那孩子虽然也吓了一跳，但我已经好好跟她说过，不用担心可奈了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1110_p", "source_sha256": "f509af45d10faee2792bc2aae4310b875a4e8bb53d4e82395370ad48e800bdc0", "ja": "それより、可奈は大丈夫か？\n悪かったな、傍にいなくて……。", "zh": "比起那个，可奈没事吧？\n对不起，没能陪在你身边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1111_036kan", "source_sha256": "faa2d8398a104f298eafbde5098c45fea9349a6f87e63d8837422284fd64e1de", "ja": "大丈夫です！　叱られてへこんじゃってましたけど、\n泣いたら、ちょっとスッキリしました。", "zh": "我没事的！虽然被批评之后有点消沉，\n但哭过之后，感觉轻松多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1112_p", "source_sha256": "53f796faa860ba9daf221ab93691e43c181633d40fa9449cb3ed884c25fa5308", "ja": "可奈。この前言った事だけど、\nあれは別に、慰めなんかじゃないからな。", "zh": "可奈，关于我之前说的那件事，\n那可不是什么安慰话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1113_p", "source_sha256": "73d9d526672db133f1e42c7cf70492059109ba8c43127c522132d5f07be1146b", "ja": "「この子は良くなる」と期待しているからこそ、\n先生は力を入れて指導してくれているんだと思う。", "zh": "正因为对你抱有“这孩子能变得更好”的期望，\n老师才会这么花心思指导你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1114_036kan", "source_sha256": "a443728a8175b991932eba7c1377a7feb90b5c05a89ee687339a5281a0ed75e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1115_p", "source_sha256": "7ddde23eca0373a08a889308d9a99c2a3e72d450e4ea08ccd4c9a790a516a8af", "ja": "でも、口で言ったところで、自信をなくしていたら\nなかなか信用できないだろうから……。", "zh": "不过，就算只是嘴上说说，如果自己都没有自信，也很难让人相信吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_111_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_111_1116_p", "source_sha256": "5dd6c3f66b78fe896326b971721e7d2b88477aeea951c0f598220c9cfbdf695d", "ja": "代わりに、これを用意したんだ。\n可奈の新曲だ。", "zh": "所以，我准备了这个作为替代。\n这是可奈的新歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
